<section class="section wrap about-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="about-portrait"><div class="portrait-frame"><img src="/assets/jake-portrait.png" width="334" height="334" loading="lazy" alt="Jake Ardoin smiling in front of a brick wall"></div><div class="portrait-label"><span class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE WORK</span><strong>Jake Ardoin</strong><span>Developer. Designer. Maker.</span></div><span class="portrait-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h2 id="about-title">A developer’s mindset.<br>A maker’s <em>curiosity.</em></h2><p class="large-copy">I’m Jake, a software developer and maker based in Baton Rouge, Louisiana, and the founder of Jake DevWorks.</p><p>I build business websites, applications, APIs, and AI tools. My background also includes developing an RFID tracking application during an internship at NASA’s Stennis Space Center and teaching programming as a supplemental instructor at LSU.</p><p>Outside the code, I work with CAD, 3D printing, electronics, and small computing platforms. I enjoy figuring out how things work—and making something useful with that knowledge.</p><div class="education"><div><span>COMPUTER SCIENCE</span><strong>Louisiana State University</strong><small>B.S. · 2021</small></div><div><span>BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION</span><strong>University of Louisiana at Lafayette</strong><small>B.S. · 2010</small></div></div><div class="social-links"><a href="https://github.com/GreatestJakeEVR" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jake-ardoin-csc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div></section>
